<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Odonata wing cells through deep time faithfully reproduces Odonata (fossil Late Jurassic–Eocene; extant Anisoptera and Zygoptera) morphology" ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2026-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Odonata (fossil Late Jurassic–Eocene; extant Anisoptera and Zygoptera) specimens and the source authors' figures." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/fbbcaf6/2026-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells.py> ;
    pk:context "script(s): 2026-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells.py; output: odonata_fossil_resegmentation.png; organism: Odonata (fossil Late Jurassic–Eocene; extant Anisoptera and Zygoptera); checkpoint commit: fbbcaf6" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1721248115>,
        <https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19899648>,
        <https://paleobiodb.org/data1.2/occs/list.csv?base_name=Odonatoptera&show=class,coords&idreso=genus> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-14-odonata-audit-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-14-odonata-audit-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells-model-fidelity>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-14-odonata-audit-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells-morphometric-validation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-14-odonata-audit-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells-overall>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-14-odonata-audit-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells-parameter-expressivity>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-14-odonata-audit-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells-repro-package>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-14-odonata-audit-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells-source-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-14-odonata-audit-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells-specimen-match> .

<https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1721248115> a pk:Paper ;
    dct:bibliographicCitation "PNAS 115(40):9905-9910 (2018)" ;
    dct:creator "Hoffmann J, Donoughe S, Li K, Salcedo MK, Rycroft CH" ;
    dct:identifier "doi:10.1073/pnas.1721248115" ;
    dct:title "A simple developmental model recapitulates complex insect wing venation patterns" .

<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19899648> a pk:Paper ;
    dct:bibliographicCitation "Zenodo (2026), CC BY 4.0" ;
    dct:creator "Eshghi S, Buesch A, Gorb S" ;
    dct:identifier "doi:10.5281/zenodo.19899648" ;
    dct:title "Critical Crack Length as an Evolutionary Constant in Odonata Wing Venation: Lessons from Fossils — Supplementary Material" .

<https://paleobiodb.org/data1.2/occs/list.csv?base_name=Odonatoptera&show=class,coords&idreso=genus> a pk:Paper ;
    dct:bibliographicCitation "https://paleobiodb.org" ;
    dct:creator "Paleobiology Database contributors" ;
